---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" section="about">
  <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:808px; padding-top:48px; padding-bottom:80px">
    <h1 class="h1">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="callout callout-sun" style="margin-top:0"><strong style="color:#14324F">Draft.</strong> This page is a starting point and should be reviewed (including against the Jamaica Data Protection Act, 2020) before launch.</div>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you request quotes we collect your name, phone number, optional email, parish, property type, bill range and any notes you add. When a business lists or claims a page we collect the business and contact details submitted.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>Quote requests are shared only with the providers matched to your request, so they can contact you. We do not sell personal information. We do not charge providers per lead for quote requests.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep quote requests for up to 12 months so we can follow up on service quality, then delete them. You can ask us to delete your information at any time via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use privacy-friendly, aggregate analytics to understand which pages are useful. We do not use advertising trackers.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
